# `robot::Robot`

An immutable compiled robot.

## Signature

```cpp
std::int64_t robot::Robot::links() const noexcept;
pluss::ScalarType robot::Robot::dtype() const noexcept;
pluss::Platform robot::Robot::platform() const noexcept;
bool robot::Robot::has_mass() const noexcept;
const std::vector<std::int64_t>& robot::Robot::parent() const noexcept;
```

## Construction

Accessors return counts, flags and the parent list.

## Methods

| Method | What it does |
|---|---|
| [`links`](RobotModel/links.md) | The number of links, which is also the number of joints. |
| [`dtype`](RobotModel/dtype.md) | The floating dtype of the compiled data. |
| [`platform`](RobotModel/platform.md) | The device the compiled data lives on. |
| [`has_mass`](RobotModel/has_mass.md) | Whether mass properties were given. |
| [`parent`](RobotModel/parent.md) | The parent index of every link; `-1` for the base. |

## Changelog

- **0.1**: initial documented surface.

